Subject: [PATCH 2/2] =?UTF-8?q?persist:=20review=20minor=20=E2=80=94=20ass?=
 =?UTF-8?q?ert=20multi-16,=20const&=20final,=20commenti=20(wave5=20t23-crc?=
 =?UTF-8?q?)=20[wave5=20t23-crc-fix]?=
